<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Beyond a <em id="id1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Single Explanation</em> of the Adam–SGD Gap</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
