<p id="A1.I14.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Adam (96 runs) (<math id="A1.I14.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{1}=\beta_{2}=\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{1}=\beta_{2}=\beta</annotation></semantics></math>)</p>
