<p id="A1.SS6.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS6.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Tokenizer <span id="A1.SS6.p3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">4mer</span> and <span id="A1.SS6.p3.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">6mer</span>.</span> We tune the learning rate <math id="A1.SS6.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>η</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta</annotation></semantics></math>, momentum <math id="A1.SS6.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math>, with batch size <math id="A1.SS6.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B=256" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B=256</annotation></semantics></math> as</p>
<ul id="A1.I15" class="ltx_itemize ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<li id="A1.I15.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
