<p id="A1.SS7.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS7.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">GAT.</span> We tune the learning rate <math id="A1.SS7.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>η</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta</annotation></semantics></math>, momentum <math id="A1.SS7.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math>, and batch size <math id="A1.SS7.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math> as</p>
