</section>
<section id="A1.SS8" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.8 </span>Experiments on softmax-attention</h3>

<div id="A1.SS8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For the experiments in <a href="#S1.F1" title="In 1 Introduction ‣ Beyond a Single Explanation of the Adam–SGD Gap" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figures</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> and <a href="#S4.F2" title="Figure 2 ‣ 4.1 Softmax-attention hypothesis. ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Beyond a Single Explanation of the Adam–SGD Gap" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>, we use the model GCNN 53M parameters (see <a href="#A1.SS2" title="A.2 Architectures ‣ Appendix A Experimental details ‣ Beyond a Single Explanation of the Adam–SGD Gap" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Section</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a>) trained on 1B tokens (Chinchilla-optimal 20 tokens/parameter).
We use <span id="A1.SS8.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">bfloat16</span> precision, 10% linear warmup with cosine scheduler to 0, and global gradient norm clipping to 1 for both Adam and SGD.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS8.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS8.p2.1" class="ltx_p">We tune the learning rate <math id="A1.SS8.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>η</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta</annotation></semantics></math>, momentum <math id="A1.SS8.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math>, and batch size <math id="A1.SS8.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math> as</p>
<ul id="A1.I18" class="ltx_itemize ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<li id="A1.I18.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I18.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I18.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">SGD (48 runs)</p>
<table id="A1.EGx17" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex53"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex53.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(\eta,\beta,B)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(\eta,\beta,B)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex53.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\in\{10^{-2},10^{-1},10^{0},10^{1}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>1</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\in\{10^{-2},10^{-1},10^{0},10^{1}\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex54"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex54.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\times\{0.9,0.95,0.99,0.999\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>0.9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0.95</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0.99</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0.999</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\times\{0.9,0.95,0.99,0.999\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex55"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex55.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\times\{64,256,1024\}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>64,256</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1024</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\times\{64,256,1024\}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I18.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I18.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I18.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Adam (48 runs) (<math id="A1.I18.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{2}=0.999" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.999</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{2}=0.999</annotation></semantics></math>):</p>
<table id="A1.EGx18" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex56"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex56.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(\eta,\beta_{1},B)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(\eta,\beta_{1},B)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex56.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\in\{10^{-4},10^{-3},10^{-2},10^{-1}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\in\{10^{-4},10^{-3},10^{-2},10^{-1}\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex57"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex57.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\times\{0.9,0.95,0.99,0.999\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>0.9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0.95</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0.99</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0.999</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\times\{0.9,0.95,0.99,0.999\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex58"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex58.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\times\{64,256,1024\}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>64,256</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1024</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\times\{64,256,1024\}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div></li>
</ul>
<p id="A1.SS8.p2.2" class="ltx_p">For <math id="A1.SS8.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B=1024" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1024</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B=1024</annotation></semantics></math>, an additional sweep is run for both SGD (<math id="A1.SS8.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta=10^{-3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta=10^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math>) and Adam (<math id="A1.SS8.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta=10^{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta=10^{0}</annotation></semantics></math>) to cover the edges induced by batch size scaling, resulting in 8 more runs.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS8.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS8.p3.1" class="ltx_p">This setup trains a total of 104 model configurations.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.F14" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14259v1/gap_fineweb_gcnn_tr_loss_ema.svg" id="A1.F14.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:381/132;" width="381" height="132"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A1.F14.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 14</span>: </span><span id="A1.F14.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">GCNN 53M parameters trained on FineWeb 1B.
</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS9" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.9 </span>Experiments on hybrid optimizers</h3>

<div id="A1.SS9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For the experiments in <a href="#S4.T1" title="In 4.3 Dissecting architectural components ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Beyond a Single Explanation of the Adam–SGD Gap" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>, we use the model GPT 50M parameters (see <a href="#A1.SS2" title="A.2 Architectures ‣ Appendix A Experimental details ‣ Beyond a Single Explanation of the Adam–SGD Gap" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Section</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.2</span></a>) trained on 1B tokens (Chinchilla-optimal 20 tokens/parameter).
In this set of experiments, particular layers are trained with Adam, while the rest of the network is trained with SGD. For both the Adam and SGD layers, we use <span id="A1.SS9.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">bfloat16</span> precision, 10% linear warmup with cosine scheduler to 0, global gradient norm clipping to 1, and a batch size of 1024.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS9.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS9.p2.1" class="ltx_p">For each hybrid configuration of the optimizer, we tune the learning rates <math id="A1.SS9.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta_{\text{SGD}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>η</mi><mtext>SGD</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta_{\text{SGD}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS9.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta_{\text{Adam}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>η</mi><mtext>Adam</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta_{\text{Adam}}</annotation></semantics></math>, momentum <math id="A1.SS9.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{\text{SGD}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>β</mi><mtext>SGD</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{\text{SGD}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS9.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{\text{Adam}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>β</mi><mtext>Adam</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{\text{Adam}}</annotation></semantics></math>, and batch size <math id="A1.SS9.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math> as</p>
<ul id="A1.I19" class="ltx_itemize ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<li id="A1.I19.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I19.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I19.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Hybrid optimizer (225 runs) (for Adam layers <math id="A1.I19.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{1}=\beta_{2}=\beta_{\text{Adam}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mtext>Adam</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{1}=\beta_{2}=\beta_{\text{Adam}}</annotation></semantics></math>)</p>
<table id="A1.EGx19" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A1.Ex59"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex59.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle(\eta_{\text{SGD}},\eta_{\text{Adam}},\beta_{\text{SGD}},\beta_{\text{Adam}},B)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mtext>SGD</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mtext>Adam</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mtext>SGD</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mtext>Adam</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle(\eta_{\text{SGD}},\eta_{\text{Adam}},\beta_{\text{SGD}},\beta_{\text{Adam}},B)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex59.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\in\{10^{-3},10^{-2},10^{-1},10^{0},10^{1}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>1</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\in\{10^{-3},10^{-2},10^{-1},10^{0},10^{1}\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex60"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex60.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\times\{10^{-4},10^{-3},10^{-2},10^{-1},10^{0}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\times\{10^{-4},10^{-3},10^{-2},10^{-1},10^{0}\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex61"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex61.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\times\{0.9,0.95,0.99\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>0.9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0.95</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0.99</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\times\{0.9,0.95,0.99\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
