<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div></li>
</ul>
<p id="A2.SS2.p3.3" class="ltx_p">For 16 epochs, training one run takes <math id="A2.SS2.p3.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\approx 60" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≈</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\approx 60</annotation></semantics></math>h on an GPU A100-80GB. Therefore, we excluded the consistently worst-performing settings from epochs 1 and 4: <math id="A2.SS2.p3.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta=0.999" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.999</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta=0.999</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.SS2.p3.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>η</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta</annotation></semantics></math> values.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS2.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.p4.1" class="ltx_p">This setup trains a total of 100 model configurations.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS2.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Epochs 4 (ResNet50).</span> Lastly, we train ResNet50 also for a larger number of steps. We tune the learning rate <math id="A2.SS2.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\eta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>η</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\eta</annotation></semantics></math>, momentum <math id="A2.SS2.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>β</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta</annotation></semantics></math>, and batch size <math id="A2.SS2.p5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>B</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B</annotation></semantics></math> as</p>
<ul id="A2.I5" class="ltx_itemize ltx_leftmargin_flush">
<li id="A2.I5.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I5.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I5.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">SGD (60 runs)</p>
<table id="A2.EGx32" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

