<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div></li>
<li id="A2.I5.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A2.I5.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.I5.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Adam (60 runs) (<math id="A2.I5.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{1}=\beta_{2}=\beta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{1}=\beta_{2}=\beta</annotation></semantics></math>)</p>
<table id="A2.EGx33" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

